{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18810","headline":"和乐天洛城春齐梁体八韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"和乐天洛城春齐梁体八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝城宜春入，游人喜意长。\n草生季伦谷，花出莫愁坊。\n断云发山色，轻风漾水光。\n楼前戏马地，树下鬬鸡场。\n白头自爲侣，绿酒亦满觞。\n潘园观种植，谢墅阅池塘。\n至闲似隐逸，过老不悲伤。\n相问焉功德，银黄游故乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}